# Backend (BE/ + worker.ts)

## Stack

- Hono app in `BE/src/app.ts` — exported and reused by `worker.ts` and `dev-server.ts`
- `isApiRequest()` gates API vs static asset serving in the Worker
- Job state in R2 (`jobs/{id}/status.json`, `jobs/{id}/stripes.zip`) with in-memory cache fallback

## Endpoints

| Route | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `POST /api/estimate` | Preview zoom, tiles, stripe dimensions |
| `POST /api/jobs` | Start job (`waitUntil` for async processing) |
| `GET /api/jobs/latest-globe` | Latest globe job with sphere preview + emptyFill/map preview URLs; else `fallback` + monitor-relative `rip.jpeg` |
| `GET /api/globe-preview/list` | Proxy → `MONITOR_ORIGIN/globe-preview/list.php` (archive filenames) |
| `POST /api/globe-preview/save?name=` | Proxy → monitor `save.php` (texture / `-thumb.jpg`; optional `placeName`/`lat`/`lng`/`sideMeters` → JPEG COM) |
| `GET /api/globe-preview/:name` | Proxy → archived JPEG on monitor host |
| `GET /api/jobs/:id` | Poll status |
| `PATCH /api/jobs/:id/progress` | Processor callback |
| `DELETE /api/jobs/:id` | Cancel queued/running job |
| `POST /api/jobs/:id/cancel` | Cancel (beacon-friendly) |
| `PUT /api/jobs/:id/files/:name` | Processor uploads preview SVG/JPEG |
| `PUT /api/jobs/:id/zip` | Processor uploads finished `stripes.zip` (marks complete) |
| `GET /api/jobs/:id/files/:name` | Serve preview SVG/JPEG |
| `GET /api/jobs/:id/download` | Download zip or `?format=pdf` (globe requires `paid`) |
| `GET /api/paypal/config` | Public PayPal client id / amount |
| `POST /api/paypal/orders` | Create PayPal order for globe zip |
| `POST /api/paypal/orders/:orderId/capture` | Capture + unlock globe zip |
| `GET /api/geocode?q=` | Nominatim forward search proxy |
| `GET /api/reverse-geocode?lat=&lng=&zoom=` | Nominatim reverse geocode (`zoom` from selection size; returns `label`) |

## Processor dispatch

```typescript
// PROCESSOR_URL → POST /process, DELETE /process/:jobId
// Local: http://localhost:8080 | Prod: https://globus-processor.rascasone.dev
```

Set `API_CALLBACK_ORIGIN` so the processor can PATCH progress (local Docker: `http://host.docker.internal:8787`; prod: Worker public origin).

## Job modes

- `mode: "map" | "globe"` (default/legacy: globe)
- Map: `squareSidePx` + `outputFormat` jpg|svg; square export only (no prewarp)
- Globe: `stripes` + `diameterCm`; `outputFormat` forced to jpg; sphere from `input.svg`, then prewarp + JPEG stripes
- Download names: globe `{place}-{cm}cm.zip`, map `{place}-{px}px.zip`

## Adding API fields

1. Update `BE/src/types.ts` and `FE/src/lib/types.ts`
2. Validate in `validateJobInput()` if part of `JobRequest`
3. Pass through `ProcessPayload` if processor needs it
4. Run `npm test` and `npm run typecheck`
